# Stack

Shapeland is an **open world adventure RPG in the browser**.

- pnpm monorepo, TypeScript `strict` everywhere.
- Packages with hard boundaries: `sim` (pure, deterministic, zero DOM) · `render` · `content` ·
  `ui` · `platform` · `tools`.
- Rendering: **WebGPU-first** via Three.js `WebGPURenderer`, automatic WebGL2 fallback. Materials
  authored in **TSL** so one source compiles to WGSL and GLSL.
- Testing: Vitest · fast-check · Playwright · golden-image visual regression · WASM provers.

## Not Godot

Shapeland does not use Godot.

- Do not use the Godot MCP server (`user-godot` / `godot`).
- Do not create `project.godot`, `.gd`, `.tscn`, `.tres`, `.import`, or Godot addons.
- Do not scaffold scenes, GDScript, or Godot editor plugins.

## Not supported in this renderer

`ShaderMaterial`, `RawShaderMaterial`, and `onBeforeCompile` do not work under `WebGPURenderer`.
Every custom shader must be TSL from the start.
